    "text": "I , Gayantha Karunatilleke , Minister of Land and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
